# Credential files go here. This file only exists so the directory is present in a fresh clone.
#
# Expected, in Netscape cookie format:
#
#   twitter.txt    X/Twitter
#   pixiv.txt      Pixiv
#   ehentai.txt    e-hentai / exhentai
#
# Browser cookie export is NOT used: Android's kernel blocks ptrace by default, so reading a
# browser's cookie database cannot work. These are plain files, which is why the bot works here
# at all - see README.
#
# Everything in this directory is gitignored. Do not commit credentials.
